UUID: fa65cb84-a76b-36f2-9058-206d935cd85e
Includes Land transformation and the machines needed. No refill material other than the overburdens from mining are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average bauxite mine recultivation world-wide (open mining)
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
